message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Village Indonesia Capacity Expansion Model (100 GW Program)"
abstract: >-
  An open-source capacity expansion and operational model for Indonesia's
  islands and village energy systems, jointly determining generation capacity
  investments and dispatch under policy scenarios. Written in Julia/JuMP.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Power-Lab/village-indonesia-100gw"
